{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q183011","formula":"C₄₆H₆₅N₁₅O₁₂S₂","hill":"C46H65N15O12S2","elements":["H","C","N","O","S"],"composition":{"C":46.0,"H":65.0,"N":15.0,"O":12.0,"S":2.0},"names":{"en":"Arginine vasopressin","ru":"Антидиуретический гормон","uk":"Аргінін-вазопресин"},"descriptions":{"en":"Vasopressin infusions are in use for septic shock patients not responding to fluid resuscitation or infusions of catecholamines (e.g., dopamine or norepinephrine) to increase the blood pressure while sparing the use of catecholamines. These argipressins have much shorter elimination half-life (around 20 minutes) than synthetic non-arginine vasopresines with much longer elimination half-life of many hours. Further, argipressins act on V1a, V1b, and V2 receptors which consequently lead to higher eGFR and lower vascular resistance in the lungs."},"fame":2,"pubchemCid":644077,"mass":1084.2,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1C[C@H](N(C1)C(=O)[C@@H]2CSSC[C@@H](C(=O)N[C@H](C(=O)N[C@H](C(=O)N[C@H](C(=O)N[C@H](C(=O)N2)CC(=O)N)CCC(=O)N)CC3=CC=CC=C3)CC4=CC=C(C=C4)O)N)C(=O)N[C@@H](CCCN=C(N)N)C(=O)NCC(=O)N","inchikey":"KBZOIRJILGZLEJ-LGYYRGKSSA-N","iupac":"(2S)-1-[(4R,7S,10S,13S,16S,19R)-19-amino-7-(2-amino-2-oxoethyl)-10-(3-amino-3-oxopropyl)-13-benzyl-16-[(4-hydroxyphenyl)methyl]-6,9,12,15,18-pentaoxo-1,2-dithia-5,8,11,14,17-pentazacycloicosane-4-carbonyl]-N-[(2S)-1-[(2-amino-2-oxoethyl)amino]-5-(diaminomethylideneamino)-1-oxopentan-2-yl]pyrrolidine-2-carboxamide","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}},{"qid":"Q21286738","names":{"en":"Wikimedia permanent duplicate item","ru":"постоянный дубликат","uk":"сторінка-постійний дублікат"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"644077","atoms":140,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":5.682,"y":-4.257,"z":0.918,"el":"C"},{"x":6.539,"y":-3.03,"z":1.261,"el":"C"},